 <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-indigo-400">rocket_launch</span>
 Pipeline de <span class="text-indigo-400">CI/CD</span>
 </h3>

 <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
 <div class="kcard p-6 border-white/5">
 <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-[5px] bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400 mb-4">
 <i class="fab fa-github text-xl"></i>
 </div>
